# Terraform

- Root: `terraform/platform/` (TFC workspace `platform`). VPN: `terraform/vpn/` (workspace `vpn`). Exact-name backends in each `versions.tf`.
- Shared VPS module: `terraform/modules/server/`.
- Vars / locals / outputs in the platform root. Optional `app_domain`: site apex/`www` on that zone; `auth`/`registry` stay on `base_domain`. Empty `app_domain` = one zone. No platform hostname on `base_domain`.
- New server types add another root beside `platform/` composing the same module.
